widgets_values:
// LOOK
A photorealistic wildlife photograph, completely free of the plastic look of AI images and the artificial feel of CG rendering. It looks as if it were taken on location with a long telephoto lens at snow height, with real optics and natural colour, a realistic exposure and fine detail in the fur and in the snow. The background is softly out of focus.

// SCENE
A wide, calm clearing in a northern pine forest on a quiet winter evening. Deep fresh snow lies in soft rounded drifts, untouched except for one neat line of small paw prints that leads from the left edge of the frame to the fox. Tall dark pine trunks stand around the clearing on both sides, with heavy snow resting on their lower branches. A faint haze of fog hangs between the trees in the distance, so the far trunks fade into a pale blue-grey.

// LIGHT
A low, warm golden-hour sun shines from the left between the trunks and lays long blue tree shadows diagonally across the snow. The warmth stays in the sunlit snow crust, in the fog where the sunbeams pass through it and in a bright warm rim light along the fox's back, ears and tail. The shadow side of the animal is filled with cool, soft light bouncing up from the snow. Natural light only.

// CAMERA
A wide landscape frame at snow height. The fox stands in the middle third of the frame in a three-quarter view, its body turned to the right and its head turned toward the camera. The whole animal and its line of paw prints are in the picture, with snow all around it.

// SUBJECT
A single adult red fox, a lean, healthy wild animal in its thick winter coat: rich rusty orange fur on the back and flanks, a clean white chest and throat, black legs sinking into the snow up to the wrists, the black backs of its ears and frosted whiskers. Its long bushy tail with a white tip rests on the snow. It is alert, its ears pointed forward, and its breath shows as a small cloud of steam in the cold air. A few fine snowflakes drift down through the sunlight and settle on its fur.

// FACE
Its face is lit cleanly by the low sun. The amber eyes are clear and bright, with one small sharp catchlight in each eye, and the focus is sharp on the eyes and on the fur of the face.

// FINISH
Authentic shallow depth of field with optical bokeh in the background. Extremely subtle natural film grain, no signs of sharpening, HDR processing or AI retouching. No text, letters or numbers in the picture.

// ANATOMY
bad anatomy, deformed animal, extra legs, missing legs, fused legs, extra tail, two tails, extra ears, distorted snout, cartoon fox, plush toy,
// IMAGE
blurry, out of focus, low quality, jpeg artifacts, oversaturated, overexposed, underexposed, washed out, heavy noise, watermark, text, subtitles, logo, signature, frame border,
// SCENE
summer, green grass, bare ground, rain, city, buildings, people, dog

